<title>USA: Specialty completes Microwave Tower buy.</title>
<headline>Specialty completes Microwave Tower buy.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR CREAST, N.M. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Teleconstructors Inc said Wednesday it had completed the acquisition of Microwave Tower Service Inc in exchange for 2.38 million Specialty shares.</p>
<p>For the fiscal year ended October 31, 1996, Microwave Tower had revenues of $13.5 million and pre-tax net income of $2.8 million, Specialty said.</p>
</text>
